      "content": "it just feels like there's no point in even staying around if i'm just a source of pain. if my existence only makes things worse for the people i love, isn't there a way to just... stop the damage? like, if i wasn't here, the pain would stop for them. doesn't that make more sense than just staying and making them suffer more?",
